  "shirleySays": "ICC 0.94. MDC: 15.9 pts. MCID: 15 pts. Formula: [(sum/n)−1]×25. Strong correlation with full DASH (r=0.97). Better for time-limited clinical settings. Validated in shoulder, rotator cuff, lateral epicondylitis, carpal tunnel, fractures. At least 10 of 11 items must be completed for a valid score.",
